<description>&lt;p&gt;Hezbollah explosives seized from two Lebanese trucks have led Lebanon's prime minister and security forces to promise a thorough investigation while Israeli artillery and air strikes continue against Hezbollah positions in southern Lebanon, causing civilian casualties. In northern Israel a Hezbollah submunition exploded in a teenager's backpack, killing Elazar Yair Wilensky and wounding dozens, prompting an IDF probe and possible hike restrictions. Qatar has pledged funding for reconstruction in southern Lebanon, announced a massive solar plant project, and its foreign minister called for Israeli withdrawal from Lebanon. The UCDP recorded 4,335 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxPNjlHdlpLN0M4ZWJ5WmRvaUkyX2p0V0RNcnBqMmFaWVhqRzVUY2l6YlJkb2xpWXNXWXBZUlRXNzUyRHVhOXl2Wlh2bHROTWdQc1BYVkdjTVR3aFNaazVxOXR1REMtdW9HM0g3R3I0SW42T05qV3pOcDA0R2d3eC0xLWlxVS1MOFRiWHhyeFNzR0ZCWVl3dVplLU9wWmNNS3JhSGRBNjBTZjduSVp5TnlDd1pQN3ljajFBMHc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Times of Israel&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.haaretz.com/israel-news/israel-security/2026-10-16/ty-article-magazine/.highlight/the-idf-failures-that-led-to-soldiers-death-and-drove-his-family-out-of-israel/000001a1-4091-ddcc-a3fd-cbb9910d0000&quot;&gt;haaretz.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Haaretz&lt;/a&gt;, &l